WEBVTT

00:06:27.861 --> 00:06:30.635
a few of them have been deciphered,

00:06:30.659 --> 00:06:33.142
but there is consensus among scholars

00:06:33.166 --> 00:06:38.359
that this is really
humanity's first alphabet.

00:06:38.383 --> 00:06:41.403
Over here, you see a paleographic chart

00:06:41.427 --> 00:06:44.520
that shows what has
been deciphered so far,

00:06:44.544 --> 00:06:47.929
starting with the letter
A, "ālep," at the top,

00:06:47.953 --> 00:06:51.614
and "bêt," in the middle, and so forth.

00:06:51.638 --> 00:06:55.227
It is time that students
of design in Africa

00:06:55.251 --> 00:06:59.444
read the works of titans
like Cheikh Anta Diop,

00:06:59.468 --> 00:07:01.560
Senegal's Cheikh Anta Diop,